  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **× and -**\n\n→ **15 ÷ 9** - 8 + 12 × 4 = 17\n\n→ 5/3 - 8 + **12 ****×**** 4** = 17\n\n→ **5/3** - 8 **+ 48** = 17\n\n→ 49.6 - 8 = 17\n\n→ 41.6 ≠ 17\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) **+ and ÷ **\n\n→ 15 + 9 × **8 ÷ 12** - 4 = 17\n\n→ 15 + **9 × 2/3** - 4 = 17 \n\n→ **15 + 6** - 4 = 17\n\n→ 21 - 4 = 17\n\n→ 17 = 17 \n\n→ **LHS = RHS** ⇒ **Satisfies the equation.**\n\n3) **× and +**\n\n→ **15 ÷ 9** + 8 × 12 - 4 = 17\n\n→ 5/3 + **8 ****×**** 12** - 4 = 17\n\n→ **5/3 +**** 96** - 4 = 17\n\n→ 97.6 - 4 = 17\n\n→ 93.6 ≠ 17\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n4) **× and ÷**\n\n→ 15 × **9 ÷ 8** + 12 - 4 = 17\n\n→ **15 × 9/8** + 12 - 4 = 17\n\n→ **135/8 + 12** - 4 = 17\n\n→ 28.8 - 4 = 17\n\n→ 24.8 ≠ 17\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 2 satisfies the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****+ and ÷\"**.",
